- the Pochhammer-loop orthogonality (README 6.1, second headline) needs Pochhammer contours;
- the kernels in angular variables (README 6.4) need the substitution 31.10.7 with its branches;
- the further confluence limits and the irregular singularity of the confluent equation
  (README 7.3–7.4) need AsymptoticExpansions' rank-one theory in logarithmic coordinates, which
